# The support floor is a decision, not whatever the default happened to be.
#
# Angular 19 supports Safari 17 and newer, so that is what this says — in
# versions, not in "last N majors". "last 2 iOS major versions" was here first
# and it was a trap: in September 2026 it resolved to iOS 18 and iOS 26, which
# quietly made the floor 18 and would emit syntax an iOS 17 phone cannot even
# parse. A floor that moves when the calendar does is not a floor.
Safari >= 17
iOS >= 17
Chrome >= 110
Firefox >= 115
Edge >= 110
not dead
